%% TRIP-014 Search and book charter trips
%% From a destination page to a booking number. Steps are labelled with requirement IDs.
flowchart TD
    A[Destination page /charter/id] --> B{Flights to the destination?}
    B -- no --> N[Notice, no form: TRIP-013-R8]
    B -- yes --> C[Form: airport, dates, travellers: R1, R2]
    C -- date missing --> C1[Red message, focus on first: R1]
    C1 --> C
    C -- valid --> D[Results /resor: R3]
    D -- address wrong --> D1[Sökningen saknar något + link to /charter: R1]
    D --> E[Choose outbound, the return list opens: R3, R5]
    E --> F[Choose return, Fortsätt: R5]
    F --> G[Resenärer /boka: passengers, contact, questions, extras: R6, R7]
    G -- something missing --> G1[Red fields, focus on first: R6]
    G1 --> G
    G --> H[Betala /boka/betala: payment method, price list: R8]
    H -- no method --> H1[Välj hur du vill betala.: R8]
    H1 --> H
    H --> I{Server checks and prices from the database: R8}
    I -- trip changed --> I1[Något i resan har ändrats: back to Resa]
    I -- ok --> J[Booking CH-XXXXXX saved once per request id: R8]
    J --> K[Summary /charter/bokad: R9]
    D -. Avbryt .-> X[Ask, then /charter: R10]
    G -. Avbryt .-> X
    H -. Avbryt .-> X
